%% section: Deep dives
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Registered: publish immutable version
    Registered --> Canary: route 1% of traffic
    Canary --> Evaluating: gates on quality and latency
    Evaluating --> Canary: hold, keep sampling
    Evaluating --> Promoting: gates pass
    Evaluating --> RollingBack: gates fail
    Promoting --> Live: step traffic up
    Live --> Draining: previous version drains
    Draining --> [*]: in-flight streams finish on their own version
    RollingBack --> Registered: old version never unloaded, so rollback is instant
